The main problem is that one can never remember the mapping so if some
predefined classes and setAs functions were included that one could
use then that would be nice.  This would not involve any change to
fread itself as long as it supported colClasses functionality in the
way read.table does.  For example. if this were provided (and also
similar functions for datetime and also Mac versions since the Mac
uses a different offset) then that would suffice for read.table and
possible fread too:

setClass("excel.date")
setAs("character", "excel.date", function(from)
structure(as.numeric(from)-25569, class = "Date")

setClass("excel.mac.date")
setAs("character", "excel.mac.date", function(from)
structure(as.numeric(from)-24107, class = "Date")

